<title>UK: Vodafone subscriber revenue drops 11.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Vodafone subscriber revenue drops 11.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British mobile phone operator Vodafone Plc said on Tuesday that average revenue per customer for the year to March 31, 1997 totalled 427 stg.</p>
<p>In the previous financial year, average revenue per customer was 481 stg.</p>
<p>Vodafone said revenue from digital customers was 558 stg and 353 stg from analogue users in the year to March.</p>
<p>&quot;On a gross basis, adding back service provider discounts, the average per customer would have been 564 stg for the year,&quot; Vodafone said in a statement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
